### =================================================================
### FAT-BODY HOST-PATHOGEN DUAL RNA-SEQ
### =================================================================
###
### This isolated entry point starts from the original paired FASTQs, runs
### fastp, maps the same reads to S. gregaria alone and competitively to
### S. gregaria plus M. robertsii, compares the host results, produces fungal
### counts, screens unplaced scaffolds, and builds Kraken family-composition
### figures. It never writes into historical runs.

include: "config.smk"
include: "rules/07_host_pathogen_dual_rnaseq.smk"


rule all:
    input:
        dual_rnaseq_final_outputs()
